# cedian_review_finding — cedian_review_finding

cedian's own host tool (trusted). Report one review finding on a changed hunk. A `blocker` keeps the change from completing until it is fixed or a person dismisses it.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** workspace-relative file path */
  path: string;
  /** 1-based line inside a changed hunk */
  line: number;
  /** lines covered (default 1) */
  count?: number;
  severity: "blocker" | "suggestion" | "info";
  message: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://cedian_review_finding.

